1104
01:04:26,370 --> 01:04:31,260
Every walking robot
is underactuated.

1105
01:04:31,260 --> 01:04:33,930
The same thing is true.

1106
01:04:33,930 --> 01:04:36,908
If I'm a humanoid,
I'm trying to control

1107
01:04:36,908 --> 01:04:37,950
