1114
01:04:53,295 --> 01:04:54,045
But they're there.

1115
01:04:54,045 --> 01:04:55,050
There's a lot of them.

1116
01:04:55,050 --> 01:04:56,160
If you count the number
of degrees of freedom,

1117
01:04:56,160 --> 01:04:57,480
